OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought over reintroduction
OL,4,Aof ferry service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has encouraged residents of a
OL,7,Fharbour town to voice views over a
OL,8,Fpassenger ferry service to the Isle of
OL,9,FMan.
OL,11,FJosh MacAlister previously said plans
OL,12,Fto reintroduce ferries between
OL,13,FWhitehaven and the Isle of Man was "a
OL,14,Fbit of a longshot" but explained he had
OL,15,Fsince had an operator express an
OL,16,Finterest in the service.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
