OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought over reintroduction
OL,4,Aof ferry service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MP for Whitehaven and Workington
OL,7,Fsaid the operator - which has a 12-seat
OL,8,Fvessel - could potentially offer fast,
OL,9,Fdirect sailings for "day trips, short
OL,10,Fbreaks and major events on the Isle of
OL,11,FMan".
OL,13,FHe asked residents to provide their
OL,14,Fviews in a survey to understand if
OL,15,Fthere was enough demand to develop the
OL,16,Fproposals further.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
